 hand tracing, players can use blades and guns to fight.\n\nMelee system:\n   Players can use the blade to block, bounce, parry enemy attacks, and intercept enemy bullets and orbs.\n\n", "short_description": "Subspace Hunter is an MR+VR dual-mode action game; players need to use guns, blades, magic and any combination of the invasion of the subspace into the real world of the epic battle. At the same time, the game supports full hand tracking interaction to play"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sh.xuking.tech/privacy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "SpatialXR", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sh.xuking.tech/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "2710427532541308"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING", "OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "25058905980413687"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982664_861577659449790_2174786538634993475_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cvOYDGJXO68Q7kNvwG-_bQa&_nc_oc=AdntCrLAVM2Yo6kc8uK8CepzY6I3paHtEvvqVJsYud6heYmkYDqVKyd2yv1d2yuwtHY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfuUhMho7hxCSaK2G9jOsJqS3OoTGqePScYAbTIpTal3pg&oe=69A834D0"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Subspace Hunter", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF",